<title>CANADA: Gendis Inc Q3 share net rises.</title>
<headline>Gendis Inc Q3 share net rises.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Oct 26</p>
<p>				1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr     profit	  C$0.10   profit	C$0.05</p>
<p> Net     profit	   1,720   profit	   847</p>
<p> Revs		     129,877		  137,164</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	 C$0.02   profit	C$6.03</p>
<p> Net	  loss	    368   profit     102,134</p>
<p> Revs		     358,978		  371,961</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Gendis Inc. Figures for nine months 1995 include discontinued operations. Results before discontinued operations were a loss of C$3,163,0000 or C$0.19 a share.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
